# Workflow: Deployment

Spec: Deployment

Purpose:
  Defines the deployment workflow for frontend and backend
  services within SDDRA's containerized environment.
  Covers build → test → stage → deploy → verify pipeline
  for each service type.

Owns: workflow\deployment.sdd

DeploymentPipeline:
  stages:
    - BUILD
    - TEST
    - STAGE
    - DEPLOY
    - VERIFY

  BUILD:
    BE:
      action: docker compose build be-builder
      artifacts: be-builder image (sddra-be-builder:local)
      runtime: RUNTIME build arg (node|python|go|java|dotnet)
      mount: ./var/be:/workspace
    FE:
      action: docker compose build fe-builder
      artifacts: nginx image with built SPA (sddra-fe-builder:local)
      framework: FRAMEWORK build arg (react|vue|angular|svelte|nextjs)
      mount: ./var/fe:/workspace
    MD:
      action: docker compose build mobile-builder
      artifacts: mobile-builder image (sddra-mobile-builder:local)
      note: Simulation only — mock APK/IPA generation

  TEST:
    BE:
      action: docker compose run --rm be-builder npm test
      mount: ./var/be:/workspace
      gate: exit 0 = PASS, exit 1 = BLOCK
    FE:
      action: docker compose run --rm fe-builder npm test
      mount: ./var/fe:/workspace
      gate: exit 0 = PASS, exit 1 = BLOCK
    MD:
      action: docker compose run --rm mobile-builder --verify
      mount: ./var/mobile-build:/workspace/output
      gate: build-report.json exists with status=COMPLETED

  STAGE:
    BE:
      action: docker tag sddra-be-builder:local sddra-be-builder:stage-${TIMESTAMP}
      mount: ./var/be:/workspace
    FE:
      action: docker tag sddra-fe-builder:local sddra-fe-builder:stage-${TIMESTAMP}
      mount: ./var/fe:/workspace

  DEPLOY:
    BE:
      action: docker compose up -d be-builder
      port: 3000 (configurable via BE_PORT env)
      healthcheck: docker compose ps be-builder
    FE:
      action: docker compose up -d fe-builder
      port: 80 (nginx default)
      healthcheck: docker compose ps fe-builder
    MD:
      action: artifacts in ./var/mobile-build/output/ (no server)

  VERIFY:
    BE:
      action: curl http://localhost:<BE_PORT>/health
      expected: 200 OK
      timeout: 30s
    FE:
      action: curl http://localhost/
      expected: 200 OK, HTML response
    MD:
      action: verify build-report.json exists and is valid JSON
      expected: status=COMPLETED

Rules:
  [DEP-01] ALL builds run inside Docker (R59-R66, R102).
  [DEP-02] ALL images are locally built (R91) — :local suffix.
  [DEP-03] ALL volumes under ./var/ (R92) — no named volumes.
  [DEP-04] ALL services have resource limits (R60/R64).
  [DEP-05] Deployment requires human approval (R37, R15).
  [DEP-06] Swagger UI must be configured in test/dev/local (R93).
  [DEP-07] BE healthcheck endpoint MUST exist at /health.
  [DEP-08] FE must serve index.html at root.
  [DEP-09] Mobile build artifacts are MOCK — clearly labeled.
  [DEP-10] Deployment failures roll back to previous stage image.

NetworkTopology:
  sdd-internal (internal: true):
    - sdd-sandbox
    - fe-builder
    - be-builder
    - mobile-builder
  External access:
    - fe-builder:80 → host:80 (via compose port mapping)
    - be-builder:3000 → host:3000 (via compose port mapping)
    - mobile-builder: no external access

State: +
